{"3736310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Underwater DuO", "steam_appid": 3736310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Control the turtle with your left hand and smash everything in your path! Control the jellyfish with your right hand and blast your enemies! How long can you survive?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwater Duo is a charming top-down action shooter where two inseparable aquatic partners venture into an unknown sea. Facing waves of hostile underwater creatures, they must rely on exceptional coordination and strength to conquer these perilous depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/a73d63309d9b0ce868f788d2d544d7a0.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/a73d63309d9b0ce868f788d2d544d7a0.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/a73d63309d9b0ce868f788d2d544d7a0.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight with both hands!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turtle and the jellyfish each have completely different controls and abilities. Only by coordinating both hands can you survive the relentless assaults of underwater creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/af64f9cc988d62a90cd3a79f812b0c3e.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/af64f9cc988d62a90cd3a79f812b0c3e.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/af64f9cc988d62a90cd3a79f812b0c3e.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Merge as one!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they collide, the jellyfish can ride the turtle, combining their strengths, covering each other’s weaknesses, and unleashing even greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/55a2b17b41452d4b9febc1085fe15528.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/55a2b17b41452d4b9febc1085fe15528.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/55a2b17b41452d4b9febc1085fe15528.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grow stronger!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the surging waves, you must constantly choose how to evolve, becoming a unique and powerful duo to face increasingly fierce enemies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/6932689eb51713e8182e05c9b5e8876f.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/6932689eb51713e8182e05c9b5e8876f.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/6932689eb51713e8182e05c9b5e8876f.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you rely on your own superb control, or team up with a perfectly in-sync friend?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>These perilous depths await your conquest!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/e236c382fff8e81acc0c2763e580d050.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/e236c382fff8e81acc0c2763e580d050.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/e236c382fff8e81acc0c2763e580d050.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Control the turtle with your left hand and smash everything in your path! Control the jellyfish with your right hand and blast your enemies! How long can you survive?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwater Duo is a charming top-down action shooter where two inseparable aquatic partners venture into an unknown sea. Facing waves of hostile underwater creatures, they must rely on exceptional coordination and strength to conquer these perilous depths!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/a73d63309d9b0ce868f788d2d544d7a0.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/a73d63309d9b0ce868f788d2d544d7a0.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/a73d63309d9b0ce868f788d2d544d7a0.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fight with both hands!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The turtle and the jellyfish each have completely different controls and abilities. Only by coordinating both hands can you survive the relentless assaults of underwater creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/af64f9cc988d62a90cd3a79f812b0c3e.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/af64f9cc988d62a90cd3a79f812b0c3e.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/af64f9cc988d62a90cd3a79f812b0c3e.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Merge as one!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they collide, the jellyfish can ride the turtle, combining their strengths, covering each other’s weaknesses, and unleashing even greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/55a2b17b41452d4b9febc1085fe15528.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/55a2b17b41452d4b9febc1085fe15528.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/55a2b17b41452d4b9febc1085fe15528.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Grow stronger!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the surging waves, you must constantly choose how to evolve, becoming a unique and powerful duo to face increasingly fierce enemies and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/6932689eb51713e8182e05c9b5e8876f.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/6932689eb51713e8182e05c9b5e8876f.webm?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/6932689eb51713e8182e05c9b5e8876f.mp4?t=1786731048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you rely on your own superb control, or team up with a perfectly in-sync friend?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>These perilous depths await your conquest!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736310/extras/e236c382fff8e81acc0c2763e580d050.poster.avif?t=1786731048\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"ht